<title>UK: Canton of Basle sets 250 million Swiss franc bond.</title>
<headline>Canton of Basle sets 250 million Swiss franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Credit Suisse.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CANTON OF BASLE</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    18.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.90    PAY DATE    18.OCT.96</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
